class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">twenty_four_hour_back</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Fuye1yLy\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">24 小时历史有无回传, </span><code>TRUE</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 表示有，</span><code>FALSE</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 表示无</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">deep_external_action</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UgLwpPV6\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">深度优化目标，具体枚举名字可查看</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-枚举值-转化类型】</a></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_types</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NxZiJyRU\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">资产类型，枚举值：</span><code>APP</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 应用</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">need_app_force</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5ao7NUGg\">external_action优化目标是否命中融合归因升级，若命中则本优化目标不可用于项目创建/编辑中</p><blockquote data-i